src/UniAudio/alac.nim is a Nim port of the Apple Lossless Audio Codec
reference implementation (github.com/macosforge/alac), decoder and encoder
both, Copyright 2011 Apple Inc., licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/UniAudio/vorbis.nim follows the Xiph.Org Vorbis I specification, with
stb_vorbis (github.com/nothings/stb), by Sean Barrett, released to the public
domain or under the MIT License at the user's choice, consulted alongside it.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/UniAudio/mp3.nim and src/UniAudio/mp3_tables.nim are a Nim port of
minimp3 (github.com/lieff/minimp3), by lieff, dedicated to the public domain
under CC0 1.0 Universal.

